WEBVTT

00:14.070 --> 00:17.020
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.200 --> 00:20.860
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.860 --> 00:26.260
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.740 --> 00:31.290
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.830 --> 00:36.120
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.080 --> 00:40.630
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.620 --> 00:43.830
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.830 --> 00:46.870
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.870 --> 00:48.950
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.950 --> 00:53.020
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.530 --> 00:58.300
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.300 --> 01:02.580
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.580 --> 01:03.990
♪Over the time♪

01:03.990 --> 01:06.010
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.010 --> 01:08.860
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.860 --> 01:12.120
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.120 --> 01:16.820
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.530 --> 01:25.180
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.850 --> 01:43.210
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.470 --> 01:46.289
=Episode 3=

01:57.440 --> 02:00.080
Mr. Luo. There are thick woods ahead.

02:00.280 --> 02:01.240
How should we go?

02:04.400 --> 02:06.320
Look, does he look good?

02:13.120 --> 02:14.840
Qi, come here.

02:16.800 --> 02:17.960
Come closer to me.

02:19.079 --> 02:19.960
All you know is to play.

02:41.600 --> 02:44.079
The Luo family of the Western Regions
is truly amazing.

02:45.360 --> 02:46.320
This way please.

03:01.400 --> 03:02.040
Master.

03:04.960 --> 03:06.600
It's been over 200 years

03:07.160 --> 03:09.240
Rehai has never been so unusual.

03:09.680 --> 03:10.400
I didn't expect it...

03:20.280 --> 03:21.480
Interesting.

03:22.280 --> 03:26.200
No, I should say
it's extremely interesting.

03:27.000 --> 03:29.880
Zhaoyan brought me important guests?

03:31.560 --> 03:32.680
Bring them to see me.

03:33.560 --> 03:34.280
Yes.

03:44.480 --> 03:46.079
It's so lucky to find

03:46.200 --> 03:48.040
such a treasured place

03:48.280 --> 03:49.280
amid the desert.

03:52.440 --> 03:54.040
But you never know
what price someone paid

03:54.160 --> 03:55.920
for such a luck.

03:58.280 --> 03:59.320
Mr. Luo, what did you say?

04:02.200 --> 04:02.840
Nothing.

04:07.840 --> 04:10.040
(Maybe there's a hidden secret)

04:11.200 --> 04:12.280
(in this desert oasis.)

04:19.000 --> 04:21.519
(The Luo Mansion)

04:28.640 --> 04:29.800
Greetings, master.

04:31.680 --> 04:33.480
The master of the Luo family
is quite imposing.

04:34.360 --> 04:35.120
Please follow me.

04:35.440 --> 04:36.200
Greetings, master.

04:38.080 --> 04:38.560
Again.

04:39.400 --> 04:39.800
Come on.

04:40.200 --> 04:42.000
Zhaoyan is nice, rich,

04:42.120 --> 04:43.720
and so respected.

04:46.720 --> 04:48.120
Do you have a crush on him?

04:49.520 --> 04:52.880
I mean, you should learn more from him.

04:54.000 --> 04:56.840
Yue Qi, I have nothing worse than him.

04:58.960 --> 05:00.840
Jinzhao, you have
one thing better than him.

05:01.760 --> 05:02.720
More confident than he is.

05:10.520 --> 05:11.920
Everyone, please take a seat

05:12.040 --> 05:13.160
and have some snacks.

05:15.800 --> 05:17.000
What a noble family.

05:17.440 --> 05:18.280
So splendid.

05:19.000 --> 05:20.040
Most of the disciples

05:20.160 --> 05:21.640
are from the Luo clan.

05:21.760 --> 05:24.440
Most of the people you see
are outside disciples.

05:25.320 --> 05:27.160
Even the outside disciples
are so graceful,

05:27.280 --> 05:29.440
I bet the clansmen must be imposing.

05:31.480 --> 05:32.040
Zhaoyan.

05:33.480 --> 05:34.040
Luo Ning.

05:35.480 --> 05:36.360
This is Luo Ning.

05:36.560 --> 05:37.480
Greet the guests.

05:37.840 --> 05:38.880
Greetings.

05:41.040 --> 05:43.560
Miss Maiming would like
to invite all the guests to meet her.

05:44.560 --> 05:45.560
Maiming wants to see them?

05:47.800 --> 05:49.560
Mr. Luo, who is Maiming?

05:52.200 --> 05:53.040
She is my younger sister.

05:53.880 --> 05:55.159
You have a younger sister?

05:55.760 --> 05:58.159
I've only heard that your parents
passed away a long time ago.

05:58.520 --> 05:59.000
Didn't expect...

06:02.160 --> 06:02.960
I'm so sorry.

06:03.280 --> 06:04.120
I didn't mean it.

06:05.200 --> 06:07.320
It's okay, let bygones be bygones.

06:08.800 --> 06:09.680
My younger sister is weak,

06:10.000 --> 06:11.160
so she rarely meets guests.

06:11.440 --> 06:13.240
After a long day of walking,

06:13.520 --> 06:15.040
I should let you take a rest early.

06:15.240 --> 06:15.960
But now,

06:16.120 --> 06:18.040
would you please go to the drawing room

06:18.160 --> 06:19.040
and spend some time?

06:19.760 --> 06:21.520
Since Miss Luo would like to meet us,

06:21.840 --> 06:22.920
we should go and see her.

06:23.480 --> 06:25.280
Then I'll take your there.

06:25.720 --> 06:26.280
Wait.

06:28.080 --> 06:29.640
This is what your father
asked me to bring you.

06:29.840 --> 06:31.160
It should be something you like.

06:32.520 --> 06:33.600
You're so busy usually,

06:33.880 --> 06:35.680
and yet my father asks you
to bring stuff for him,

06:36.120 --> 06:37.400
I'm sorry about that.

06:38.080 --> 06:38.680
Maybe

06:39.440 --> 06:40.480
I'll turn him down next time.

06:42.720 --> 06:45.760
Master, since when
do you learn to make jokes?

06:45.960 --> 06:46.760
You may leave.

06:46.880 --> 06:47.720
I'll take them there.

06:47.880 --> 06:48.360
Okay.

06:49.600 --> 06:50.960
Then please wait here.

06:51.080 --> 06:52.360
I'll take you there later.

06:53.040 --> 06:53.400
Okay.

06:57.159 --> 06:58.120
Did you see that?

06:58.640 --> 06:59.640
- What?
- What?

07:01.720 --> 07:02.920
She likes him.

07:03.240 --> 07:04.320
- Who?
- Who?

07:07.560 --> 07:09.280
Luo Ning likes Mr. Luo.

07:12.080 --> 07:14.120
But her face didn't blush.

07:14.400 --> 07:15.640
How did you tell that?

07:16.320 --> 07:17.480
When one likes another one,

07:17.560 --> 07:19.760
you can tell the affection in the eyes.

07:22.880 --> 07:23.480
Jinzhao.

07:23.600 --> 07:25.600
Did you see this in her eyes?

07:27.400 --> 07:29.160
Why are you learning from her?

07:32.320 --> 07:33.560
Like this?

07:37.200 --> 07:39.200
What? I can't see anything. What?

07:40.800 --> 07:42.560
Jinzhao, why are you covering my eyes?

07:42.680 --> 07:43.640
I just want to.

07:44.000 --> 07:44.840
You look over there.

07:59.280 --> 07:59.920
Cang Feng.

08:00.160 --> 08:00.840
Master.

08:01.720 --> 08:03.800
You'd greet Cang Feng first
every time you return,

08:04.320 --> 08:05.600
aren't you afraid I'll get angry?

08:08.240 --> 08:09.520
(This voice sounds so weird.)

08:12.440 --> 08:13.560
This is my younger sister.

08:14.160 --> 08:17.080
Mr. Yue, Miss Yue, Mr. Ju.

08:17.840 --> 08:19.360
While investigating
the matter of Qiyuan Sect

08:19.600 --> 08:21.600
in Yinghui Fort,

08:21.720 --> 08:23.480
my elder brother has been
taken care of by you three.

08:24.280 --> 08:26.120
Thank you so much.

08:27.040 --> 08:28.760
Miss Luo, don't be.

08:30.000 --> 08:32.679
Little Yue, why is
Mr. Luo's younger sister

08:32.799 --> 08:34.880
talking behind a screen?

08:35.000 --> 08:36.400
That's what all noble ladies do.

08:36.559 --> 08:38.159
They rarely show their faces.

08:39.159 --> 08:39.880
I see.

08:40.360 --> 08:42.320
But in the storybooks,

08:42.440 --> 08:45.760
the descriptions
of the noble ladies' voices are

08:45.840 --> 08:49.240
sweet and melodious.

08:52.040 --> 08:54.560
My younger sister had a serious illness
when she was a child,

08:54.760 --> 08:56.280
and thus her voice got damaged.

08:56.600 --> 08:57.320
Sorry about that.

08:58.720 --> 08:59.880
It's okay.

09:15.680 --> 09:17.320
So beautiful!

09:20.280 --> 09:22.240
Which is more beautiful,
she or Miss Shuo Xuan?

09:23.240 --> 09:23.960
Both...

09:27.320 --> 09:28.840
Mr. Zhaoyan is cool and dashing,

09:28.960 --> 09:30.400
and your younger sister is so beautiful.

09:30.520 --> 09:32.880
The Luo mansion is
truly a treasured place.

09:34.040 --> 09:35.440
Miss Yue, you are really adorable.

09:35.720 --> 09:37.440
Zhaoyan and I are twins.

09:37.560 --> 09:39.680
We were born just
a quarter of an hour apart.

09:40.960 --> 09:42.080
Twins?

09:42.960 --> 09:44.600
I've heard
due to the condemnation of heaven,

09:44.760 --> 09:46.200
the Luo family's twins would die young.

09:46.520 --> 09:47.920
Then aren't you two...

09:54.640 --> 09:56.800
How about being my little sister?

09:56.960 --> 09:58.960
There's a lot of delicious food here.

10:10.200 --> 10:10.960
Really?

10:11.080 --> 10:12.600
Can I have as much as I want?

10:13.520 --> 10:14.640
As much as you want.

10:17.360 --> 10:18.360
I didn't expect

10:18.960 --> 10:20.960
Mr. Luo is a courteous person,

10:21.720 --> 10:24.040
while Miss Luo likes
to get close to others.

10:27.360 --> 10:28.760
Miss Yue is so adorable.

10:29.120 --> 10:32.320
Mr. Yue, I didn't expect you care about
your younger sister that much.

10:32.800 --> 10:33.920
Sorry about that.

10:34.040 --> 10:35.680
It's natural. Hope you can understand.

10:36.840 --> 10:38.000
Once we arrived the Luo mansion,

10:38.160 --> 10:39.880
Miss Luo immediately
sent someone to invite us

10:40.440 --> 10:42.240
and even recognized us well.

10:42.680 --> 10:43.520
That's really impressive.

10:45.240 --> 10:47.520
The Luo family has been based in
Western Regions for a hundred years.

10:47.720 --> 10:49.440
Of course we know a lot.

10:50.800 --> 10:51.800
Then I assume

10:52.480 --> 10:53.640
you've already known why Mr. Luo

10:53.720 --> 10:55.280
brought us here.

10:55.960 --> 10:56.560
Exactly.

10:57.640 --> 10:59.280
I've sent someone to find it out.

10:59.960 --> 11:02.800
Miss Yue set out
from Wuyan Village three years ago,

11:03.000 --> 11:05.080
and has been upholding justice
along the way with you, Mr. Yue.

11:05.480 --> 11:07.840
Yet, she has never been
in contact with Qiyuan Sect.

11:08.280 --> 11:10.640
I don't think Little Yue
is Lord Ming either.

11:10.800 --> 11:13.680
My elder brother has told me
about what he saw in Fujin Hall.

11:15.560 --> 11:17.480
Ordinary people will be
sucked out of the life force

11:17.720 --> 11:19.280
when they touch the Qiyuan Orb.

11:19.640 --> 11:20.480
While Miss Yue

11:20.840 --> 11:23.200
would absorb the life force
of the Qiyuan Orb.

11:23.880 --> 11:25.600
It is so suspicious.

11:26.400 --> 11:27.760
Qi can absorb the Qiyuan Orb,

11:29.120 --> 11:30.520
it could mean her origins

11:30.880 --> 11:32.200
might be related to Qiyuan Sect,

11:32.960 --> 11:34.760
but you can't assume
she's the Lord Ming.

11:36.120 --> 11:38.400
Exactly, just find the real Lord Ming,

11:38.520 --> 11:39.400
I'll be cleared.

11:41.520 --> 11:42.880
You make a point.

11:43.120 --> 11:44.400
Looks like you two are determined

11:44.640 --> 11:47.240
to pursue this lead.

11:48.960 --> 11:49.600
Yes.

11:51.440 --> 11:54.120
Zhaoyan, I read the ledger you sent me.

11:55.240 --> 11:56.600
It not only has records

11:56.800 --> 11:59.080
of the daily goods transaction
of Qiyuan Sect

11:59.560 --> 12:03.240
(Fujin Hall, Ledger)
and records of sending out those who got kidnapped.

12:04.720 --> 12:06.040
On the fifth day of the February.

12:06.560 --> 12:07.840
Nine captives.

12:08.600 --> 12:09.560
Escort three people.

12:10.440 --> 12:11.320
Sixty jins of provisions.

12:11.960 --> 12:12.760
Captives?

12:14.960 --> 12:18.320
Those demons are comparing
people to captives?

12:19.200 --> 12:20.240
Oh my.

12:21.040 --> 12:23.000
In this ledger alone,

12:23.320 --> 12:25.760
nearly a hundred people were suffered.

12:26.760 --> 12:28.520
Qiyuan Sect is really wicked.

12:29.200 --> 12:31.560
Maiming, did you find anything?

12:32.080 --> 12:33.720
In this ledger,
for escorting one person,

12:34.280 --> 12:35.600
five jins of provisions
will be prepared.

12:36.400 --> 12:39.600
And that's what one person
needs for five days.

12:40.800 --> 12:42.320
So, this place

12:43.320 --> 12:45.320
must be another Qiyuan Sect stronghold.

12:46.640 --> 12:48.480
But there are so many places
that can be reached

12:48.560 --> 12:50.120
within five days of Yinghui Fort.

12:50.280 --> 12:51.880
Do we have to check them one by one?

12:52.520 --> 12:56.600
The ledger records the hundred jins
of smoked horse meat received.

12:57.600 --> 12:58.400
I know about this.

12:58.600 --> 13:00.720
Smoked horse meat
is a specialty of Luori Village.

13:00.800 --> 13:01.560
It is quite delicious.

13:02.080 --> 13:03.200
All you know is delicious food.

13:04.440 --> 13:05.720
Luori Village is indeed

13:05.840 --> 13:07.480
within five days' journey
of Yinghui Fort.

13:07.720 --> 13:08.600
That should be it.

13:09.320 --> 13:11.040
Shall we set out as soon as possible?

13:12.880 --> 13:14.640
You've just come right
from Yinghui Fort.

13:14.840 --> 13:16.480
Why don't you take a rest
at the Luo mansion now

13:16.720 --> 13:18.600
and set out for Luori Village tomorrow?

13:20.640 --> 13:22.520
Okay, thank you.

14:01.880 --> 14:03.280
Are you sure you want to try again?

14:06.120 --> 14:07.440
For the first time in 200 years

14:07.880 --> 14:10.080
Rehai has shown an unusual reaction.

14:10.880 --> 14:12.960
Nine Springs move with the natural law,

14:12.960 --> 14:15.080
which is the source
of nourishment for all things.

14:15.560 --> 14:16.680
Rehai in the Nine Springs

14:16.680 --> 14:18.680
provides endless of life force.

14:19.400 --> 14:21.040
To retain water for desert,

14:21.160 --> 14:22.760
the ancestors
of the Luo family sacrificed me

14:23.040 --> 14:24.160
to restrain Rehai

14:24.320 --> 14:25.440
for their own use.

14:25.720 --> 14:27.160
So the territory
of the Luo family could have

14:27.160 --> 14:29.040
a constant supply of water.

14:29.960 --> 14:30.680
While I

14:30.680 --> 14:33.120
cannot leave the Luo mansion anymore.

14:33.680 --> 14:36.080
Only after my death did I realize

14:36.840 --> 14:38.760
that my soul is bound

14:39.520 --> 14:41.280
with Rehai.

14:43.920 --> 14:46.680
Perhaps this is an opportunity
given by the god.

14:47.680 --> 14:49.400
I couldn't miss it.

15:37.280 --> 15:37.840
Maiming.

15:39.040 --> 15:40.520
Maiming.

15:42.400 --> 15:43.040
Maiming.

15:43.840 --> 15:44.480
Maiming.

15:45.200 --> 15:47.120
Cang Feng, take him
to the chamber and change clothes.

15:47.240 --> 15:48.040
I'll treat him.

15:48.320 --> 15:48.800
Yes.

15:57.520 --> 15:58.400
I feel something is wrong.

15:58.640 --> 15:59.400
What's wrong?

16:01.200 --> 16:03.720
This Luo family seems so weird.

16:04.200 --> 16:04.960
For example,

16:05.880 --> 16:08.000
Mr. Luo seems to
listen to his younger sister.

16:10.000 --> 16:13.200
Mr. Luo's younger sister

16:13.480 --> 16:15.560
is more like the master
of the Luo family.

16:16.440 --> 16:17.080
Besides,

16:18.680 --> 16:20.920
why is Luo Maiming being so nice to you?

16:32.040 --> 16:33.280
I've figured it out.

16:34.200 --> 16:37.520
I think it's not Miss Luo
who is being so nice to me,

16:37.800 --> 16:39.920
but Zhaoyan.

16:40.560 --> 16:43.880
Maybe he really has a crush on me.

16:45.880 --> 16:46.920
You are absolutely right,

16:47.960 --> 16:49.120
but don't say it anymore.

16:54.240 --> 16:57.120
Why aren't you competing
with me for the food today?

17:06.680 --> 17:10.000
I know you must want
to compete with me for them.

17:15.160 --> 17:17.000
It doesn't feel right.

17:17.280 --> 17:20.920
Why is Luo Maiming
suddenly being so nice to you?

17:26.920 --> 17:27.560
Maybe

17:28.920 --> 17:32.240
you have anything to do
with the Luo family.

17:33.040 --> 17:35.720
No. You just stay right here,

17:36.520 --> 17:37.640
and I need to go investigate.

18:09.040 --> 18:10.960
Maiming, how are you?

18:11.920 --> 18:12.720
Zhaoyan.

18:13.520 --> 18:14.400
I failed again.

18:16.240 --> 18:18.640
I still can't lift
the Luo family's curse.

18:20.680 --> 18:21.320
Why?

18:22.440 --> 18:24.240
Why did you try today?

18:25.120 --> 18:27.480
Because we have important guests today.

18:28.360 --> 18:31.840
Is that why you showed up
specifically to meet Miss Yue?

18:32.840 --> 18:34.680
Besides being the Lord Ming,

18:34.880 --> 18:36.080
does she have any other identities?

18:37.440 --> 18:39.400
When the girl named Yue Qi

18:39.800 --> 18:41.440
entered the barrier,

18:42.400 --> 18:45.120
both Rehai and key ring
made an unusual reaction.

18:46.640 --> 18:49.360
Are you saying Miss Yue
resonated with Rehai?

18:50.240 --> 18:51.920
I've been involved with Rehai for years,

18:52.040 --> 18:53.160
I couldn't be wrong.

18:54.280 --> 18:55.080
I thought...

18:56.040 --> 18:56.760
You thought

18:56.880 --> 18:59.240
that she is the key
to lifting the Rehai curse, right?

18:59.480 --> 19:00.680
But she's not.

19:00.760 --> 19:01.360
No.

19:02.360 --> 19:05.360
She is still the key
to lifting the Rehai curse.

19:06.160 --> 19:07.480
She knows a lot of things.

19:08.840 --> 19:09.680
I have to test her.

19:14.440 --> 19:15.160
What?

19:16.400 --> 19:18.680
Aren't you reluctant to?

19:21.240 --> 19:22.200
Of course not.

19:24.080 --> 19:25.560
Even if it has nothing to do with Rehai,

19:26.800 --> 19:28.920
if she truly is the deceitful Lord Ming,

19:29.400 --> 19:31.840
I wouldn't allow her
to bring chaos to the world.

19:32.800 --> 19:34.480
Zhaoyan,

19:35.360 --> 19:38.280
you can always make such decent speech.

19:40.600 --> 19:43.640
After all, I don't have much time left.

19:57.240 --> 19:59.480
Maiming, I've brought you a gift.

20:00.560 --> 20:03.040
This is the Mountain Scene painting
from Yinfeng Pavilion.

20:03.760 --> 20:05.480
I found it quite artistic,

20:05.640 --> 20:06.720
so I bought it.

20:08.080 --> 20:08.840
Is that so?

20:10.800 --> 20:12.480
I think it's far from
as good as that one.

20:13.320 --> 20:14.120
That one?

20:24.440 --> 20:25.200
That one...

20:27.160 --> 20:28.920
I drew that one a few days ago

20:29.400 --> 20:30.200
at Yinghui Fort,

20:30.760 --> 20:32.760
when the sun shone after rain

20:33.080 --> 20:35.080
and two rainbows occurred.

20:36.000 --> 20:39.000
Your painting is not very skillful,

20:39.680 --> 20:41.560
but it's the thought that counts.

20:42.000 --> 20:44.600
Alright, if you like it,

20:45.000 --> 20:46.960
whenever I see a special scenery,

20:47.400 --> 20:48.280
I'll paint it for you.

20:51.240 --> 20:53.520
That would be great.

20:56.280 --> 20:57.000
Maiming.

20:58.200 --> 20:59.840
When there's a surefire way

21:00.600 --> 21:01.560
to lift the curse,

21:02.360 --> 21:03.720
we'll take action, okay?

21:05.160 --> 21:06.120
I'd be worried about you.

21:10.000 --> 21:10.840
Okay.

21:13.080 --> 21:14.720
I'll find a solution later.

21:18.160 --> 21:20.000
Now, you'd take a rest.

21:38.600 --> 21:41.080
Mountain Scene painting.

21:41.600 --> 21:43.360
I cannot leave the Luo mansion,

21:44.080 --> 21:46.760
what does this beautiful scenery
have to do with me?

21:47.880 --> 21:50.600
It only breeds more resentment.

21:52.960 --> 21:54.160
If you like it,

21:55.800 --> 21:59.600
whenever I see a special scenery,
I'll paint it for you.

22:02.640 --> 22:03.440
Zhaoyan.

22:05.840 --> 22:10.920
I really hate your naivety.

22:18.240 --> 22:20.360
I made a pact with that wolf-demon.

22:20.760 --> 22:23.000
It used half its cultivation
to save my daughter.

22:23.200 --> 22:24.240
Three months later,

22:24.360 --> 22:25.960
I'll go back and let it eat me.

22:27.280 --> 22:31.040
(Father of Luo Zhaoyan, Luo Wangping)
If this medicine can keep Zhaoyan alive,

22:32.640 --> 22:34.360
I'll be worth it even I die.

22:34.640 --> 22:37.400
The demonic power in this elixir
does not work for me.

22:38.360 --> 22:41.000
It seems that as long as
the condemnation of heaven exists,

22:41.400 --> 22:44.360
I can't get my life force
from anywhere else.

22:45.680 --> 22:46.400
Zhaoyan.

22:48.560 --> 22:50.600
What a good child.

22:51.880 --> 22:53.440
If I tell Zhaoyan

22:54.240 --> 22:56.400
that she is destined to die young

22:56.880 --> 22:58.200
as one of the twins

22:59.640 --> 23:02.240
because I stole half her lifespan,

23:03.120 --> 23:05.320
(Luo Maiming)
would she still be so kind to me?

23:08.720 --> 23:09.560
(Maiming.)

23:10.240 --> 23:12.120
(From now on,
we will be the closest of kin.)

23:12.640 --> 23:14.360
(I will try hard to protect you.)

23:14.920 --> 23:17.600
(We live and die together.)

23:17.920 --> 23:18.680
(Okay?)

23:21.040 --> 23:24.440
(Live and die together.)

23:25.080 --> 23:26.120
(Zhaoyan.)

23:27.080 --> 23:30.240
(Have you regretted the promise
you made 20 years ago?)

23:31.670 --> 23:37.710
♪Write about your struggle♪

23:37.710 --> 23:43.790
♪For you are being irrational and silly♪

23:43.790 --> 23:50.000
♪Bet your whole life♪

23:50.700 --> 23:56.020
♪No answer, no give up♪

23:57.240 --> 23:58.600
(I need to find a way to get in.)

24:03.080 --> 24:04.960
Why has Jinzhao come back so soon?

24:08.520 --> 24:09.360
Jinzhao.

24:11.400 --> 24:12.280
Maiming.

24:13.600 --> 24:15.640
I hope I'm not disturbing you.

24:16.880 --> 24:17.520
A bit.

24:17.880 --> 24:19.760
I was going to take a nap.

24:20.600 --> 24:21.600
I'll come later then.

24:21.920 --> 24:23.800
No need. Since you're already here,

24:23.880 --> 24:25.040
come in please.

24:25.720 --> 24:26.240
Okay.

24:32.800 --> 24:34.000
I heard from Zhaoyan

24:34.320 --> 24:36.400
that you don't remember the past.

24:38.800 --> 24:40.240
Neither does Jinzhao.

24:42.160 --> 24:43.120
Then do you want to know

24:43.240 --> 24:44.600
what happened in the past?

24:45.560 --> 24:47.760
Yes. So does Jinzhao.

24:48.120 --> 24:51.200
We've been looking for our origins
for three years already.

24:52.440 --> 24:56.040
Actually, I could do that
for you and Mr. Yue.

24:56.400 --> 24:58.400
Really? How?

25:12.560 --> 25:13.840
Recall those memories

25:13.960 --> 25:16.280
forgotten in the depths
of the sea of awareness.

25:21.400 --> 25:24.360
Do you know about Rehai?

25:28.280 --> 25:30.000
Qi, look.

25:30.440 --> 25:32.360
(Shennong Nine Springs)
This is Shennong Nine Springs.

25:32.440 --> 25:35.200
Rehai, Pureness, Dragon Pool.

25:35.960 --> 25:40.000
Rehai contains an endless life force,

25:40.320 --> 25:43.600
which can turn a desert into an oasis.

25:50.200 --> 25:51.760
(Rehai)

25:53.360 --> 25:54.480
Shennong Nine Springs?

25:58.720 --> 26:00.800
Mr. Luo, just a misunderstanding.

26:01.520 --> 26:02.120
Misunderstanding.

26:03.360 --> 26:05.360
Distracting the guards and
breaking into our forbidden land,

26:05.600 --> 26:07.200
is just a misunderstanding?

26:07.600 --> 26:09.600
You take me lightly, don't you?

26:09.920 --> 26:10.840
Then do you let me go

26:11.440 --> 26:12.320
or not?

26:12.960 --> 26:13.680
What do you think?

26:19.040 --> 26:19.920
Who are you?

26:23.280 --> 26:24.760
I am Yue Qi.

26:25.680 --> 26:26.960
Only Yue Qi?

26:27.840 --> 26:31.080
Yes, Qi.

26:36.240 --> 26:37.200
Once you are in danger,

26:37.320 --> 26:38.840
you only know to summon Miss Yue.

26:38.960 --> 26:40.960
Those who don't know
might think she is your weapon.

26:43.240 --> 26:44.640
What happened three years ago?

26:49.960 --> 26:50.600
Qi.

26:51.560 --> 26:54.000
From now on, you are my disciple.

26:54.120 --> 26:55.240
Thank you, Master.

26:58.960 --> 26:59.680
Master.

27:06.960 --> 27:07.400
Oh no.

27:19.920 --> 27:21.520
Master, the incense is burning out.

27:22.400 --> 27:23.480
What did you see?

27:24.200 --> 27:25.560
I saw...

27:28.520 --> 27:29.600
What did you see?

27:30.200 --> 27:32.000
I saw...

27:33.760 --> 27:34.520
Master.

27:34.920 --> 27:37.440
Master? Who is your master?

27:38.320 --> 27:39.120
Yue Jinzhao is back.

27:39.440 --> 27:40.920
My master is...

27:41.960 --> 27:42.680
is...

27:43.680 --> 27:44.400
Say it.

27:45.000 --> 27:46.440
My master is...

27:49.800 --> 27:51.040
Jinzhao, you're back.

27:52.480 --> 27:54.400
Yes, what are you talking about?

27:54.680 --> 27:56.640
Come on, I'm in.

27:58.240 --> 27:59.400
Mr. Yue is back.

27:59.720 --> 28:01.080
I won't disturb you anymore.

28:02.040 --> 28:02.960
I'll take my leave.

28:13.960 --> 28:15.480
Miss Yue is really adorable.

28:15.960 --> 28:17.800
I really want to make friends with her.

28:28.160 --> 28:30.400
How is it? Did you get bullied?

28:31.000 --> 28:32.080
Of course not.

28:32.200 --> 28:34.240
Maiming wanted to make friends with me.

28:35.360 --> 28:37.400
Don't make friends casually.

28:37.920 --> 28:38.800
You don't even know her,

28:38.920 --> 28:39.920
yet you make friends with her.

28:40.560 --> 28:42.880
Do I have to know it to make friends?

28:43.040 --> 28:45.040
We don't know who we are either.

28:48.400 --> 28:49.160
Where have you been?

28:50.400 --> 28:51.920
I broke into
the Luo family's Octagonal Tower.

28:52.520 --> 28:53.040
And I saw...

28:54.480 --> 28:56.160
I saw a pretty amazing mural.

28:57.400 --> 28:58.160
What is it painted?

28:59.360 --> 29:00.320
A god

29:00.800 --> 29:02.840
and nine springs with different shapes.

29:03.120 --> 29:04.960
Nine springs?

29:05.960 --> 29:07.400
Shennong Nine Springs.

29:09.320 --> 29:09.840
Do you know it?

29:11.960 --> 29:13.040
I just dreamt

29:13.200 --> 29:15.480
that Master showed me
the painting of Shennong Nine Springs.

29:17.240 --> 29:17.760
Dream?

29:19.040 --> 29:20.400
What did Luo Maiming do to you?

29:20.880 --> 29:22.080
She didn't do anything,

29:22.360 --> 29:24.080
just lit incense,

29:24.320 --> 29:26.800
helping us recall our origins.

29:30.280 --> 29:32.280
So what have you recalled? Tell me.

29:34.200 --> 29:37.240
Maiming, just now Yue Jinzhao
broke into the Octagonal Tower.

29:37.400 --> 29:38.520
Why do you let him go?

29:39.240 --> 29:42.880
Is the Octagonal Tower a place
where they can get in if they want?

29:43.560 --> 29:44.920
You let him in on purpose, right?

29:46.240 --> 29:50.480
I just used the Enchanting Incense
to help Yue Qi recall her memories.

29:51.120 --> 29:51.800
It can prove

29:52.840 --> 29:55.000
that she is definitely not Lord Ming.

29:55.120 --> 29:56.640
But she is familiar
with the Nine Springs.

29:57.320 --> 30:00.120
And the reaction of Rehai is true.

30:05.360 --> 30:07.080
So you're trying to figure out

30:07.320 --> 30:08.720
the relationship

30:08.800 --> 30:10.120
between Miss Yue and Rehai.

30:10.600 --> 30:12.480
If Miss Yue could take away Rehai...

30:12.560 --> 30:14.680
Then we would be free.

30:17.560 --> 30:18.320
Maiming,

30:19.760 --> 30:20.960
if Rehai is taken away,

30:21.240 --> 30:23.120
then the people in this area
will be deprived of water

30:23.200 --> 30:24.280
and displaced.

30:24.680 --> 30:26.280
If the world knows it,

30:26.360 --> 30:27.920
how would they think of our Luo family?

30:29.080 --> 30:29.840
So what?

30:31.000 --> 30:34.760
Rehai should move with the natural law.

30:34.920 --> 30:37.520
If I didn't restrain Rehai
to the Luo mansion

30:37.640 --> 30:39.840
to provide endless of life force,

30:40.480 --> 30:42.200
how could a desert like this

30:44.200 --> 30:45.520
get water?

30:47.000 --> 30:48.400
They live a comfortable life.

30:49.840 --> 30:52.880
But who cares about our curse?

30:54.640 --> 30:56.680
I've been trapped
in the Luo mansion for hundreds of years

30:56.800 --> 30:58.760
and never stepped
out of the Luo mansion.

30:59.720 --> 31:01.200
And you can

31:01.520 --> 31:03.360
only pretend to be a man

31:03.520 --> 31:04.800
to take on the role of family master.

31:05.680 --> 31:07.720
Don't you resent this curse?

31:08.920 --> 31:10.880
The twins of the Luo family
would die young.

31:11.520 --> 31:12.120
Even you

31:13.720 --> 31:14.880
will die soon.

31:17.520 --> 31:19.160
But I'm the master of the Luo family.

31:19.240 --> 31:20.960
So what?

31:22.440 --> 31:23.200
Are you a god

31:25.440 --> 31:26.240
or a fairy?

31:28.280 --> 31:31.280
You want to take responsibility
for the lives of so many people.

31:33.000 --> 31:35.640
You can feed and clothe them,

31:37.080 --> 31:39.040
help them to cultivate Tao.

31:39.800 --> 31:42.440
Do you even want to take care
of their metempsychosis?

31:47.400 --> 31:47.960
Maiming.

31:50.040 --> 31:51.840
You don't change your mind.

31:52.960 --> 31:54.160
Neither do I.

32:00.480 --> 32:01.080
Alright.

32:02.400 --> 32:03.280
Stop this.

32:04.640 --> 32:07.920
You'll continue to accompany
Yue Qi and Mr. Yue

32:08.720 --> 32:11.280
to investigate Qiyuan Sect.

32:12.080 --> 32:15.360
I have to find out more about Yue Qi.

32:15.720 --> 32:17.080
As for Yue Jinzhao,

32:18.000 --> 32:19.680
he is very perceptive.

32:21.040 --> 32:22.480
You have to be careful.

32:22.880 --> 32:23.440
I understand.

32:24.720 --> 32:27.200
Regarding the relationship
between Miss Yue and Rehai,

32:27.880 --> 32:30.000
I'll ask her another time.

32:31.440 --> 32:33.360
Then you'd take a rest, I'll be leaving.

32:44.640 --> 32:46.360
So what I saw in the Octagonal Tower

32:46.480 --> 32:48.720
is the mural of Shennong Nine Springs.

32:49.840 --> 32:51.320
Luo Maiming tested you,

32:51.840 --> 32:53.960
because he suspects
you have a connection with Nine Springs.

32:55.440 --> 32:56.080
Jinzhao,

32:56.840 --> 32:58.680
we have all seen Shennong Nine Springs.

32:58.960 --> 33:00.720
Shennong Nine Springs must be real.

33:00.960 --> 33:02.680
My master must also be real.

33:05.400 --> 33:08.480
Master, master,
all you know is your master.

33:09.480 --> 33:11.080
You didn't believe it before.

33:13.480 --> 33:15.560
But in my dream,

33:15.680 --> 33:17.520
no matter how hard I try,

33:17.640 --> 33:19.400
I couldn't see his face clearly.

33:21.680 --> 33:22.280
Alright.

33:22.600 --> 33:24.720
We'll find him one day.

33:28.400 --> 33:31.160
Jinzhao, I'm so sleepy.

33:35.320 --> 33:36.320
You fell asleep that quick.

33:40.120 --> 33:40.840
Are you a pig?

34:02.520 --> 34:03.440
(Enchanting Incense.)

34:10.920 --> 34:11.639
Mr. Yue.

34:12.000 --> 34:13.159
You and your sister are colluding.

34:13.679 --> 34:15.040
What enchantment have you cast on Qi?

34:18.560 --> 34:19.239
It's Memory Exploration.

34:20.199 --> 34:21.120
Mr. Yue, don't worry.

34:22.159 --> 34:23.560
I was sickly as a child,

34:23.760 --> 34:25.360
Maiming had done it to me all the time,

34:25.520 --> 34:27.280
to remind me of
the happy memories from my childhood

34:27.400 --> 34:28.560
and take away the pain.

34:29.080 --> 34:30.239
Qi has fainted

34:30.760 --> 34:32.080
and you told me not to worry.

34:33.199 --> 34:34.080
Rest assured.

34:34.159 --> 34:35.719
Miss Yue will wake up soon.

34:36.159 --> 34:37.239
Maiming did so,

34:37.400 --> 34:38.360
just to help you recall

34:38.480 --> 34:39.679
those memories from three years ago.

34:40.159 --> 34:41.639
Even if you suspect us,

34:41.840 --> 34:43.639
there's no need to be so despicable.

34:43.719 --> 34:44.560
It's so terrifying.

34:46.760 --> 34:48.239
Mr. Yue, if you are that worried,

34:48.639 --> 34:48.960
Now I...

34:49.040 --> 34:50.320
Don't pretend it.

35:11.280 --> 35:12.560
Aren't you afraid them

35:14.040 --> 35:15.720
will reveal the secret of Rehai?

35:15.960 --> 35:17.200
I wish everyone in the world

35:17.760 --> 35:19.960
knows the secret of Rehai.

35:27.000 --> 35:29.920
The Luo house is about to get lively.

35:31.480 --> 35:33.640
I'm really exciting.

36:11.480 --> 36:15.000
♪A meteor streaking across the sky♪

36:16.500 --> 36:19.790
♪Burns the past♪

36:20.560 --> 36:23.410
♪Forget one's name♪

36:27.510 --> 36:31.310
♪Deep feelings hidden behind the mask♪

36:32.530 --> 36:35.440
♪Only seen through the eyes♪

36:36.280 --> 36:39.820
♪Who can see clearly♪

36:41.460 --> 36:48.110
♪It is meant to be me fighting for you♪

36:49.330 --> 36:56.180
♪Even if the end is doomed♪

36:57.520 --> 37:05.460
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

37:05.460 --> 37:12.430
♪Leaving love a wordless explanation♪

37:29.460 --> 37:33.460
♪The seemingly random paths♪

37:34.520 --> 37:38.000
♪The burn mark♪

37:38.520 --> 37:42.800
♪Behind them are all secrets♪

37:45.400 --> 37:49.840
♪Those unexpected encounters♪

37:50.550 --> 37:53.870
♪Are all carefully♪

37:54.480 --> 37:58.540
♪Arranged by me♪

37:59.510 --> 38:06.860
♪It is meant to be me fighting for you♪

38:07.440 --> 38:14.450
♪Even if the end is doomed♪

38:14.450 --> 38:23.440
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

38:23.440 --> 38:30.700
♪Leaving love a wordless explanation♪

38:31.470 --> 38:38.900
♪It is meant to be me
doing my best for you♪

38:39.470 --> 38:46.860
♪Even if all my efforts may go in vain♪

38:47.540 --> 38:55.060
♪Loving you in spite of everything♪

38:55.600 --> 39:05.140
♪Leaving evidence of love♪
